<section class="values" aria-labelledby="values-heading" id="values">
  <div class="wrap values-grid">
    <div class="values-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What I care about</p>
      <h2 id="values-heading">The question I return&nbsp;to.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="values-body prose">
      <p class="opening">
        How do we make sure this century goes well for all sentient beings?
      </p>
      <p>
        The technologies we build today, including AI, could shape the lives of billions of people and hundreds of billions of animals. I want to use my career to help them flourish, especially by making sure those with little voice are considered in the decisions shaping our future.
      </p>
      <p>
        Underneath all of it is Vipassana meditation, every morning and evening. It's something of a compassion amplifier for me, and it keeps me honest about paying attention, which seems to be where everything else starts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .values {
    padding-block: var(--section-y);
    background: var(--linen-warm);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Hair-line top border in warm amber for a quiet section delineation */
  .values::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: min(60rem, 90%);
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 55%, transparent) 20%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 55%, transparent) 80%,
      transparent
    );
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 18rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    }
  }

  .values-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 360;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 96, "SOFT" 70;
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 1.3rem + 1.2vw, 2.125rem);
  }

  .opening {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    font-weight: 340;
    font-style: italic;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 48;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 50ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }


  .values-body p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .values-body p + p {
    margin-top: var(--sp-5);
  }
</style>
